<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-MT Edon half year net profit A$5.2m.</title>
<headline>RTRS-MT Edon half year net profit A$5.2m.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-02-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year to Dec 31</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		     8.13 vs 0.94</p>
<p>    Net			     profit 5.23 vs loss 4.90</p>
<p>    Sales				   47.58 vs 29.02</p>
<p>    Other income			   0.35 vs 0.35</p>
<p>    Abnormal items			  nil vs loss 7.62</p>
<p>    Tax			    expense 2.90 vs credit 1.78</p>
<p>    Interest				 1.44 vs 0.83</p>
<p>    Depreciation			   9.90 vs 8.42</p>
<p>    Minorities				nil vs nil</p>
<p>NOTE: Mt Edon Gold Mines NL is currently subject to a joint takeover offer from Camelot Resources NL and Canada's Teck Corp Inc at A$2.15 per share. The company has rejected the offer as inadequate.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 373 1800</p>
</text>
